{"text":"The snow doesn't melt, so the river runs low. And one morning, it stops moving. Frozen, bank to bank. Under the ice, the deep water still moves, slow and dark, east. That's bad news for the fish. Good news for you. The crocodile can't come up the bank anymore. Only the tip of its snout sticks up through a hole it kept open. Its heart has slowed almost to nothing. Alligators do this today, in frozen swamps.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["T","h","e"," ","s","n","o","w"," ","d","o","e","s","n","'","t"," ","m","e","l","t",","," ","s","o"," ","t","h","e"," ","r","i","v","e","r"," ","r","u","n","s"," ","l","o","w","."," ","A","n","d"," ","o","n","e"," ","m","o","r","n","i","n","g",","," ","i","t"," ","s","t","o","p","s"," ","m","o","v","i","n","g","."," ","F","r","o","z","e","n",","," ","b","a","n","k"," ","t","o"," ","b","a","n","k","."," ","U","n","d","e","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","i","c","e",","," ","t","h","e"," ","d","e","e","p"," ","w","a","t","e","r"," ","s","t","i","l","l"," ","m","o","v","e","s",","," ","s","l","o","w"," ","a","n","d"," ","d","a","r","k",","," ","e","a","s","t","."," ","T","h","a","t","'","s"," ","b","a","d"," ","n","e","w","s"," ","f","o","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","s","h","."," ","G","o","o","d"," ","n","e","w","s"," ","f","o","r"," ","y","o","u","."," ","T","h","e"," ","c","r","o","c","o","d","i","l","e"," ","c","a","n","'","t"," ","c","o","m","e"," ","u","p"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","a","n","k"," ","a","n","y","m","o","r","e","."," ","O","n","l","y"," ","t","h","e"," ","t","i","p"," ","o","f"," ","i","t","s"," ","s","n","o","u","t"," ","s","t","i","c","k","s"," ","u","p"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","a"," ","h","o","l","e"," ","i","t"," ","k","e","p","t"," ","o","p","e","n","."," ","I","t","s"," ","h","e","a","r","t"," ","h","a","s"," ","s","l","o","w","e","d"," ","a","l","m","o","s","t"," ","t","o"," ","n","o","t","h","i","n","g","."," ","A","l","l","i","g","